{
  "section": "intraday-display",
  "engine": null,
  "specVersion": "v1 (2026-08-13, ratified; incl. 4b addition 2026-08-14)",
  "note": "Pins RATIFIED v1 of spec/daily-macros/intraday-display.md. Display-layer arithmetic, engine-independent (engine null): a consumer computes these from the returned plan + the day's log. EXPECTED-RED until such a consumer exists. kind field routes assertion style: so_far (numeric, abs tol 1e-3 kcal, UNROUNDED \u2014 display rounding is presentation), net_band (exact string or null), intake (numeric), flags (booleans). Oracle verified against BOTH documented snapshots (design-brief canonical 3PM day and the reference-rendering two-workout day) plus midnight convergence before emission. CONVENTIONS the spec does not state, adopted here: band bounds are inclusive at +-200/+-500 ('<=', sibling convention); connected-path NEAT model rate = neatKcal/960 waking minutes. 4b tombstone: deleted sessions carry status='deleted' in inputs; the row-persistence and sync-matcher halves of that ruling are app/db-side and are covered by the test plan, not these vectors.",
  "toleranceKcal": 0.001,
  "vectors": [
    {
      "id": "accrual-canonical-3pm",
      "status": "ratified",
      "kind": "so_far",
      "inputs": {
        "minutesSinceMidnight": 900,
        "rmr": 1908,
        "neatKcal": 378,
        "eatenKcal": 1650,
        "sessions": [
          {
            "kcal": 1205,
            "actualTimeMin": null
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected": {
        "resting": 1192.5,
        "movement": 189.0,
        "workout": 0,
        "digestion": 165.0,
        "burned": 1546.5
      },
      "why": "The design-brief canonical snapshot: resting 1908*900/1440=1192.5; movement fallback 378*(480/960)=189; run planned (actualTime null) contributes ZERO despite the day being 62% elapsed (sessions atomic); digestion 10% of eaten."
    },
    {
      "id": "accrual-two-workout-3pm",
      "status": "ratified",
      "kind": "so_far",
      "inputs": {
        "minutesSinceMidnight": 900,
        "rmr": 1908,
        "neatKcal": 394.9,
        "eatenKcal": 1650,
        "sessions": [
          {
            "kcal": 228.7,
            "actualTimeMin": 480
          },
          {
            "kcal": 1205.3,
            "actualTimeMin": null
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected": {
        "resting": 1192.5,
        "movement": 197.45,
        "workout": 228.7,
        "digestion": 165.0,
        "burned": 1783.65
      },
      "why": "The reference-rendering day: done swim counts in full (228.7), planned run zero. Burned 1783.7 -> displays 1,783."
    },
    {
      "id": "midnight-convergence",
      "status": "ratified",
      "kind": "so_far",
      "inputs": {
        "minutesSinceMidnight": 1440,
        "rmr": 1908,
        "neatKcal": 394.9,
        "eatenKcal": 4152,
        "sessions": [
          {
            "kcal": 228.7,
            "actualTimeMin": 480
          },
          {
            "kcal": 1205.3,
            "actualTimeMin": 1050
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected": {
        "burned": 4152.1
      },
      "why": "Check 1: at 1440 min, all sessions done, eaten=target, fallback-path burned == engine TDEE exactly (1908+394.9+1434+415.2=4152.1). Proration converges to the plan at midnight."
    },
