      },
      "expected": {
        "logged": 1650,
        "planned": 0,
        "remaining": 2502,
        "projected": 1650
      },
      "why": "Check 3: deleting every planned entry changes remaining not at all (2502 == 2502). EA and net are actuals-only, so they are byte-identical across the two vectors above."
